Release source and package notices
----------------------------------
Each release publishes `linux-<version>-<architecture>-source.tar.zst` beside
the binary packages. The source archive contains the exact prepared source
used for the build. It embeds this `LICENSE`, `NOTICE`, and `LICENSES/` bundle,
plus the resolved Debian and XanMod upstream notices, under
`linux/Documentation/cloud-kernel-bbrv3/`. Release hashes and signatures cover
the source archive. Binary and development packages install the project notice
and reference license bundle in their platform's conventional documentation or
license directory.
